---
import {
  legalEntity,
  privacyInfrastructure as infra,
  analytics,
  analyticsEnabled,
} from '../../data/site';
import { t } from '../../i18n';
const l = 'en' as const;
---

<h1>Privacy policy</h1>
<p class="todo">
  Test environment version. A legal review is required before publication. The Russian version of
  this policy is the governing one.
</p>

<p>DECOBROSCREW aims to keep the processing of personal data on its public site to the minimum.</p>
<p>
  The site has no user registration, no personal accounts, no newsletter subscription and no
  built-in forms for sending requests.
</p>
<p>
  To get in touch, a visitor can go to an external service such as Telegram or WhatsApp on their
  own, or open their email client.
</p>
<p>
  After moving to an external service, information is processed according to the rules of that
  service.
</p>

<h2>Technical data</h2>
<p>
  When you visit the site, the hosting infrastructure may automatically process technical
  information needed to deliver the page and keep it secure.
</p>
<p>This information may include:</p>
<ul>
  <li>IP address;</li>
  <li>date and time of the request;</li>
  <li>address of the requested resource;</li>
  <li>HTTP response status;</li>
  <li>browser type or User-Agent;</li>
  <li>technical details of the connection.</li>
</ul>
<p>The exact log fields and retention period will be stated after the production host is chosen.</p>
<p>DECOBROSCREW does not use technical logs to build marketing profiles of visitors.</p>
<p class="todo">
  Hosting: {t(infra.hostingProvider, l)}. Log fields: {t(infra.logFields, l)} Retention:{' '}
  {t(infra.logRetention, l)}
</p>

<h2>Cookies</h2>
{analyticsEnabled ? (
  <p>
    The site sets analytics cookies only after you accept them in the banner. Your choice is stored
    in the browser (localStorage); clear the site data in your browser to change it.
  </p>
) : (
  <p>In its current version the site should not use non-essential cookies.</p>
)}
<p>
  If the technical architecture changes, this section must be updated before the change goes live.
</p>

<h2>Analytics and advertising systems</h2>
{analyticsEnabled ? (
  <p>
    With your consent the site uses
    {analytics.yandexMetrikaId && ' Yandex Metrica (Yandex LLC, Russia)'}
    {analytics.yandexMetrikaId && analytics.ga4Id && ' and'}
    {analytics.ga4Id && ' Google Analytics 4 (Google LLC, USA)'}. They collect pseudonymous data:
    pages viewed, referrer, device and browser type, approximate location. Session recording
    (Webvisor) is off. Meta Pixel, Hotjar and Microsoft Clarity are not used.
  </p>
) : (
  <p>
    The current version of the site does not use Google Analytics, Yandex Metrica, Meta Pixel,
    Hotjar, Microsoft Clarity or session replay systems.
  </p>
)}

<h2>External services</h2>
<p>
  When you follow links to Telegram, WhatsApp, email or other external resources, you leave the
  DECOBROSCREW site.
</p>
<p>After that, data processing rules are set by the respective service.</p>
<p>
  The Contact page can show a Yandex Maps map (Yandex LLC, Russia). It is not loaded automatically —
  only after you press “Show map”. Your browser then connects to Yandex servers, which receive your
  IP address and browser data and may set their own cookies under the Yandex privacy policy.
</p>

